[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Single-Source-of-Truth Ground Data System and I&T Platform (.NET 11)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRATA-GDS-001
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: Manifest-Synchronized Ground Command and Telemetry Dictionary Loader
STATEMENT: >>>
The ground control platform (StrataGround) shall load mission commands, telemetry channels, engineering-unit calibration curves, red/yellow limit thresholds, and partition/slot inventories directly from mission_dict.json into thread-safe FrozenDictionary lookups and enforce MANIFEST_HASH lock-step synchronization with the flight build.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Consuming the exact manifest-generated ground dictionary eliminates manual command/telemetry database drift during FlatSat, TVAC, and flight operations.
<<<
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
ARTIFACT: dotnet/StrataForge.Ground/MissionDictionary.cs
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STRATA-SYS-005

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRATA-GDS-002
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: Real-Time Red/Yellow Telemetry Limit Monitoring with Persistence
STATEMENT: >>>
The ground control platform shall continuously evaluate calibrated engineering telemetry against lower/upper warning (Yellow) and error (Red) bounds in a thread-safe monitor with configurable persistence debouncing and structured alert callbacks.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Persistence-debounced Red/Yellow limit monitoring prevents transient single-sample glitches from flooding operator consoles while catching genuine thermal, power, and health anomalies immediately.
<<<
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
ARTIFACT: dotnet/StrataForge.Ground/LimitMonitor.cs
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STRATA-SYS-005

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRATA-GDS-003
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: Flight Sequence (.seq) and Parameter Table (ParamBank) Compilers
STATEMENT: >>>
The ground control platform shall provide round-trip compilers and decompilers translating human-readable relative/absolute flight command sequences and parameter tables into MANIFEST_HASH-stamped, CRC-32C-verified binary flight images alongside CCSDS TC, ECSS-E-ST-70-41C (PUS-C), EventRecord, and NvLogRecord Span codecs.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Deterministic compile/decompile verification before uplink prevents syntax errors, mismatched opcodes, or stale schema hashes from reaching flight software.
<<<
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
ARTIFACT: dotnet/StrataForge.Ground/FlightCodecs.cs
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STRATA-SYS-005

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRATA-GDS-004
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: Multithreaded Channel Stream Broker, PCAP Archival, CSV Export, and Async I&T Test API
STATEMENT: >>>
The ground control platform shall provide a multithreaded Channel-backed telemetry/command stream broker with async UDP ingress, parallel worker dispatch, modular packet handlers, standard Wireshark-compatible PCAP binary capture/replay, async CSV export, and a GroundTestSession automation API supporting SendCommand, SendPusTc, WaitForTelemetryAsync, WaitForEventAsync, WaitForPusTmAsync, and AssertLimitsNominal.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Multithreaded Channel-backed stream processing and scriptable async I&T test procedures with lossless PCAP archival allow identical test suites to run unattended across host SIL, Verilator HIL, FlatSat, and TVAC campaigns.
<<<
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
ARTIFACT: dotnet/StrataForge.Ground/TelemetryBroker.cs
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STRATA-SYS-008

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRATA-GDS-005
STATUS: Implemented
TITLE: Concurrent Zero-Dependency Live Mission Control Web Console and REST API
STATEMENT: >>>
The ground control platform shall provide a concurrent browser-based Mission Control web console and JSON REST API exposing live calibrated telemetry and limit badges, interactive CCSDS TC and PUS-C command uplink, flight sequence compilation, command history, and live event streams without requiring external web frameworks or third-party packages.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A zero-dependency concurrent browser console deploys immediately on air-gapped cleanroom FlatSat and mission operations workstations.
<<<
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
ARTIFACT: dotnet/StrataForge.Ground/GroundWebConsole.cs
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: STRATA-SYS-008

[[/SECTION]]
